,"rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-05T22:55:15-07:00","id":926867,"title":"","content":"It really says something about a game that it can be so damn buggy and still be so amazing. The NPC's make this game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1078-froggy711","name":"Froggy711","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1078_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-05T23:48:30-07:00","id":926890,"title":"","content":"Just want to point out that it isn't up to Onyx Path to license VtM, they are a licensee themselves. White Wolf would have to be the ones to do the licensing. Here's a link to an article that may be of interest.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.pcgamer.com/vampire-bloodlines-trademark-filed-by-white-wolf/?utm_content=buffer288cf&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_source=facebook&amp;utm_campaign=buffer_pcgamer\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/6wrizW8mYnu4sFZGPqmmH-1600-80.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.pcgamer.com/vampire-bloodlines-trademark-filed-by-white-wolf/?utm_content=buffer288cf&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_source=facebook&amp;utm_campaign=buffer_pcgamer\" target=\"_blank\"> \"Vampire Bloodlines\" trademark filed by White Wolf </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.pcgamer.com/vampire-bloodlines-trademark-filed-by-white-wolf/?utm_content=buffer288cf&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_source=facebook&amp;utm_campaign=buffer_pcgamer\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.pcgamer.com/vampire-bloodlines-trademark-filed-by-white-wolf/?utm_content=buffer288cf&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_source=facebook&amp;utm_campaign=buffer_pcgamer </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Is Jack coming back? </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-06T14:01:11-07:00","id":927268,"title":"","content":"I remember the thing which struck me most about Vampire: Bloodlines and that was the fact it was able to combine successfully so many different kinds of creatures/elements from the vampire line's history. They had the Anarch vs. Elder conflict, the Camarilla vs. Sabbat, the effects of Humanity, the Masquerade's importance, the inhuman treatment of ghouls, Gehenna, Thin Bloods, the Madness of the Malkavians, and even the spookiness of the Tremere. About the only things missing was the Followers of Set, Assamites, Inconnu, Golconda, and Ravnos.<br /> <br /> Hell, if Pisha was a member of the Tal'ma're then they're in the game too.<br /> <br /> It was a packed-packed game.<br /> <br /> But none of it felt forced either.<br /> <br /> <u><b>A short top list of what I liked:</b></u><br /> <br /> 1. The Anarchs have never felt more relevant and likable than they did with Nines' group. I suspect part of that might be Heather's doing.<br /> <br /> 2. The Thin Bloods are awesome and they're the only vampires I've ever wanted to protect. Lily and E are just such nice vampires, much nicer than you are really.<br /> <br /> 3. Everything which needs to be said about the Hotel level has been said but it's still awesome.<br /> <br /> 4. The Kindred of the East I've always hated but they actually work here, especially when contrasted to the less Orientalist Chinatown.<br /> <br /> 5. The Society of Leopold actually didn't look like a complete bunch of losers this game. However, it turns out, they WERE a complete bunch of losers which makes their genuine danger all the better.<br /> <br /> 6. Vivi, you evil tease. I admit, I prefer the mod which allows her to dance for you but there's something to be said the signature Toreador is all flirt, no action.<br /> <br /> 7. Heather Poe's horrible state as a slave but you totally wanted to keep as one too. It was...terrible.<br /> <br /> 8. Prince La Croix is the greatest douche since Prince Lodin.<br /> <br /> 9. Jeanette is vampire Harley Quinn and who doesn't love Harley?<br /> <br /> 10. The werewolf &quot;fight&quot; was awesome. I love how they kept werewolves being impossible to kill for normal vampires.<br /> <br /> 11. Brother Vick's mission is just so off kilter but foreshadows the Sabbat. Are they Sabbat? Baali? Just some insane Caitiff? Path of Evil Revelations worshipers? We'll never know.<br /> <br /> 12. Humans actually are relevant in the game! There's cool human characters like Fat Larry, Venus Dare, and so on.<br /> <br /> 13. Killing Andre is as close to killing Vykos as you're probably going to get.<br /> <br /> 14. Smiling Jack really is a character. The choice of Bender as his VA is perfect. He's also so much more dangerous than he appears and as sneaky an Elder as the rest of them.<br /> <br /> 15. How few people got the swanky penthouse during the first run because La Croix is such an enormous douchebag.<br /> <br /> 16. Caine is almost literally your co-pilot.<br /> <br /> 17. Chunk!<br /> <br /> 18. The Malkavian Run.<br /> <br /> 19. The Nosferatu Run isn't that bad either.<br /> <br /> 20. The entirety of the wereshark hunt and your demon hunter friend Yuki.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 07-06-2016, 05:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-06T14:04:40-07:00","id":927270,"title":"","content":"Bit of trivia, Jeanette was the main inspiration for the comic adaptation of Harley Quinn. Both look and personality.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-06T15:48:36-07:00","id":927315,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darksider</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/926155-vampire-the-masquerade-bloodlines-retrospective?p=927270#post927270\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bit of trivia, Jeanette was the main inspiration for the comic adaptation of Harley Quinn. Both look and personality.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Oh, for sure. While Harley appeared in the comics long before Bloodlines, her change in appearance from her old costume, to the one she wore in Arkham Asylum(and in the comics that followed), totally ripped off of Jeanette.<br /> <br /> Which is cool by me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-06T15:58:08-07:00","id":927321,"title":"","content":"I hope Jeanette somehow warps herself to whatever city we move to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}